OL,4,CEgyptian authorities arrest motorist   
OL,5,Cover tanker crash that killed 31       
OL,6,GEgyptian authorities have arrested a   
OL,7,Gman accused of causing a tanker crash  
OL,8,Gand massive fire that killed 31 people 
OL,9,Gon a busy Cairo highway.               
OL,11,FThe public prosecutor's office said    
OL,12,Fthe motorist had confessed to driving  
OL,13,Fat 110km/h (68mph) along a section of  
OL,14,Fring road, to the north of the old     
OL,15,Fcity centre, and clipping the tanker   
OL,16,Fwith the side of his car as he changed 
OL,17,Flanes.                                 
